      <div id="addon">
        <p>This book strives to identify and introduce the durable intellectual ideas of embedded systems as a technology and as a subject of study. The emphasis is on modeling, design, and analysis of cyber-physical systems,
which integrate computing, networking, and physical processes.</p>
