<h1>Lee & Seshia: Adoptions Worldwide</h1></div>
<div id="content">


<i>Introduction to Embedded Systems: A Cyber-Physical Systems Approach</i> has been adopted for
use by at least <b>282 institutions in 53 countries</b> spanning 6 continents. We list the known institutions below.
This list is based on requests we have received from instructors for teaching material
(slides, solutions to homework, etc.) for this textbook.
If you know of any errors in or omissions from this list, please let us know
at <a href="mailto:authors@leeseshia.org">authors@leeseshia.org</a>.

